# Copy this to each target repo as `.github/CODEOWNERS`.
#
# With "Require review from Code Owners" enabled on the main branch protection rule,
# every PR (including odd-contributor[bot]'s) needs explicit approval from the maintainer.
# The bot is a distinct identity (odd-contributor[bot]) and cannot self-approve, so this is
# the third structural layer of the merge gate (after draft:true and branch protection).
#
# Default owner is the maintainer; swap for a GitHub team (e.g. @opendatadiscovery/maintainers) if you prefer.

